<title>UK: BOE allots 285 mln stg in repo, 1.05 bln shortage.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 285 mln stg in repo, 1.05 bln shortage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 285 million stg of assistance in repos to June 30 and July 1.</p>
<p>The repo rate was unchanged at 6.5 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank forecast a money market shortage of 1.05 billion stg.</p>
